{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And the priest of Midian had seven daughters.</b> Jethro was the chief of the priests of Midian. And did he have no son to tend his flock? Rather, he had separated himself from idolatry, and the people of his city had ostracized him, and he found no shepherd — therefore he required his daughters to tend his flock."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:55:49.367524444Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}